{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_2001_p", "source_sha256": "258377f01edd1e3241649f606468af6c8c90cb68a35e14a0b08c62d415b54d75", "ja": "（美希に、新作ゲーム宣伝の仕事が入った。\nためしに、そのゲームを遊ばせてみたけど……）", "zh": "（美希接到了宣传新游戏的工作，\n所以我才让她先试玩了那个游戏……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_2002_003mik", "source_sha256": "6ae837264c9b09066e3fe846c64cdf9aea4ddb2ae1b165705f0a0fc2b92dda2b", "ja": "……むー。{$P$}、\nこのゲーム、つまんないの。", "zh": "……唔～{$P$}，\n这个游戏好无聊喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_2003_p", "source_sha256": "a833f6f1d431402332278e13a07737cb78b05a3245e2aa7195a2c673ae53f0a7", "ja": "えっ、そうか？　めずらしく集中して\nやってるから、楽しんでるのかと思ってたよ。", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？难得看你这么投入，\n我还以为你玩得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_2004_003mik", "source_sha256": "fcc10d07e0a9a11275af4ab0f126b413780a512d1deab792cfefcd51a521a7fe", "ja": "ミキ、もう飽きたから、ちょっとお昼寝してくるね。\nおやすみなさいなの～。", "zh": "美希已经玩腻了，要去睡个午觉。\n美希先睡了唷～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_2005_p", "source_sha256": "7280a2a57f1206d48c94849610815fe834bfff170c6b70abd26f161d0ab12975", "ja": "ああ、おやすみ、美希……ん？　ウソだろ！？\nこのゲーム……もうクリアされてるぞ！？", "zh": "嗯，去睡吧，美希……嗯？不会吧！？\n这个游戏……已经全部通关了啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_2006_003mik", "source_sha256": "ee7bfc220bdfcddda5a84327dec8a6c9866893d439b1663e98ea542eb9c3c649", "ja": "あふぅ。次は一緒に遊べるゲーム、持ってきてね、\n{$P$}。", "zh": "啊呼，下次要拿可以一起玩的游戏来喔，\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
